{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_88f8897dcdd82b2bc128f44a6edd2889a2dd609032981ea5f72c689fa5a80245","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"letta-ai/letta-code@f2bd2392a824 snapshot 28b1a65f09718697","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_371a612d340b31455914ce1bbd56d87ae11a8330ca745b67b09b819c2c2f6530","slc_3d9a6327410bd056748d327870802bc0132ba782e24faebe4abcff667d894b8b","slc_5f1f1418d2b60b3d6a2a3149085062cdde965d0360139f695e1f97f3e7261695","slc_6aafbc33140999f24e4ea378464f97fe32e74c41200949632803a4a4a1537844"],"source_ids":["src_cf78e11954445d4b8b89cd2fedfc8e17"],"text":"Letta Code is distributed as the npm package @letta-ai/letta-code, installed globally via npm, and run with the `letta` command in a project directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a5af5e66f9b7ec630cf5849be87015b824226d2caa4e8cb36fafeda8d6bc02b6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"letta-ai/letta-code@f2bd2392a824 snapshot 28b1a65f09718697","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_116298bf338b2f136c427a9e4a0ecdffda7fa5b74adb7a78d0c5aa1db4a7ceb4","slc_16b3487298640ffb80f97c2690e8dd1f142d9e8318b695e865f00e62c4697e37","slc_4292886c6362f35705d9cd5f7b3d8ce4ea19cc8d3d7ccbc26c4b8831db3d26cb","slc_540884f5c682b2bc8913132246707df97e8eea01a6a8727af906d9597de2828a","slc_be54f4e66a20192b2d6293fbae36287ba8ef3d517b917a0416f07cffbdbb8fe5"],"source_ids":["src_31c1236ca2145d5381f5cf0d4496deab"],"text":"A plan document specifies a bounded resume-tail fast path for boot/resume, with a backend getConversationResumeTail operation returning messages and pending approvals, and forbids conversation enumeration during normal boot.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_aa91f3cd8e00f1038f0642b4ddad49270ffd46eff271899f42bb88928a5560ef","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"letta-ai/letta-code@f2bd2392a824 snapshot 28b1a65f09718697","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2850075e463ab50dbb68b2874e499367bd400d31f8a7bd6cf512b907efa3a214","slc_da9dfb73f01e26d8d8ebb0cb3654d7198a706bc7c57490d620e60fa29e50a48f","slc_fd51a1b8c20f62d182e4c64443f7ecdf67a0c8d0ec83bcb948a9c5bb4b5efb64"],"source_ids":["src_cf78e11954445d4b8b89cd2fedfc8e17"],"text":"Skills load from global (~/.letta), project-scoped (.agents/skills), and agent-scoped (MemFS) locations, and can be installed from GitHub, ClawHub, or Hermes Skills Hub with `letta skills install`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_af2163f126c36bc2be5d465fe8af34f4edb0309259661cdc66ca2d5ac18b6c25","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"letta-ai/letta-code@f2bd2392a824 snapshot 28b1a65f09718697","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_50506c1097cf37cc6488972ece5f5b74c7a92eebeda7e47942da4c326362c896"],"source_ids":["src_1e266e03bae95ddcbacada3142726014"],"text":"The Nix flake builds the CLI with Bun; dependency resolution is driven by the checked-in bun.lock, with a generated bun.nix enabling reproducible offline Nix builds.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ba1bf2a9771b6650f3912fdcc2dbfb5ac4a52bf4f56f82ec7c51dea906a1bfb4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"letta-ai/letta-code@f2bd2392a824 snapshot 28b1a65f09718697","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6d68100073dfdb9f82f691a16bafabf6ecd137e1aab491fdff425af6d12b65e4","slc_e7d5052dca09179ece579f359c7dc4a68fb521f661f84cfb279a654922514f04"],"source_ids":["src_a1638063f650540daf5a1f1887067ac7"],"text":"A mod-learning harness (scripts/mod-learning/learn-mod.ts) runs a headless agent to generate a candidate mod, then a second headless eval with LETTA_MODS_DIR pointed at it, saving prompts, output, and a pass/fail report under .letta/mod-learning-runs/.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d338eb607bc396e4231717c3d02b0f41570d497fda647f9a6755aa95951af61e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"letta-ai/letta-code@f2bd2392a824 snapshot 28b1a65f09718697","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_df2ded1a87bdce652ca4d10c7d33db3d37f942963aecf29078a2013677955c46"],"source_ids":["src_a1638063f650540daf5a1f1887067ac7"],"text":"The /mods learn TUI command never auto-installs learned mods; users must review the generated candidate before copying it into their mod directory and running /reload.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f0b286b5159d06786ef6d6efc694c78ef59c848b171f22134e16fd8ccb31ab93","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"letta-ai/letta-code@f2bd2392a824 snapshot 28b1a65f09718697","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2822cc83b818fb0718027fb81bb1872f7fabd7d036e4a9d7062bc650bf7a8775","slc_a6582e0be531e882546d7dca33618d9777dc8d2850721676f38e6861cd30c1a1"],"source_ids":["src_cf78e11954445d4b8b89cd2fedfc8e17"],"text":"Cloud-stored agents can run on multiple machines: `letta server --computer-name` registers a computer, `letta computers list/current` manage routing, and `--computer` routes headless messages to a specific machine or the cloud sandbox.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:12:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2f9e92b7c1f547c283e850d26069cf7d"}
